omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LMO6ZfWE7xUQ7kNvwEJpyRN&_nc_oc=AdqM6sT-wrtxKITVTnYHPKpPkylCGAG1Te6Ka4gHwmeslZjEC_e_3jS6k7ywfyyu7Bw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1PFtoLMZs4Gmoir58IX7mN_n_tCLvm5zUpjqMilY5R6A&oe=69DA2EF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jPPDEC4oPyQQ7kNvwGrs-rL&_nc_oc=AdpwnB-5lG6gWQKa90S0lIXV-DceqE-yHgUJUqRKSAlMGWHZ4Y71bxQR6vRv5OkCzdY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2D3zFuVi69ueBj23Au1tkzZcf4RDOAS46KZbgH4e6X5w&oe=69DA3056"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KbKWhiQEsQwQ7kNvwFKWf7D&_nc_oc=Adr6Cl_jF55qtAjpf46cXM-KjXlacPloemZmj3ZIsWuFQ0ctzQ6TROp2o88zrY3DRUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3rpHxKCTi0eMMT5YJXOY0JLlZkios0AA2K6XNA9SoTOA&oe=69DA4577"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://